<title>POLAND: HANDLOWY JULY NET RISES TO PLN 52.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>HANDLOWY JULY NET RISES TO PLN 52.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 52.68 vs   45.99</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   62.38 vs   69.67</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 91.40 vs   85.07</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     144.22 vs  127.99</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY					1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					312.97 vs  436.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  474.55 vs  605.01</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		707.77 vs  644.58</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues   1.016.08 vs  830.21</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Handlowy SA</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
